  "schema": "math_problem_sources/v1",
  "description": "Every file in this repository that supplies math or code problem statements, and the split each one owns. Priority is eval > rl > sft > pretrain, so a problem claimed by a higher-priority split is refused by every lower-priority builder. Pretraining declares no sources of its own: it is the residual and receives whatever no evaluation or post-training set has claimed. Historical and superseded artifacts stay listed -- a retired SFT pool still contaminated the checkpoints trained on it, and a problem the base model has already memorized is no less contaminated for the pool having been replaced.",
